{"1-10":{"people":[{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"aaron-h0175","name":"Aaron","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":8}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H8628","lemma":"תָּקַע","tr":"ta·qa","gloss":"to blow","lang":"h","inPassage":8,"uses":68},{"base":"H2689","lemma":"חֲצֹצְרָה","tr":"cha·tso·tse·rah","gloss":"trumpet","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":29},{"base":"H8643","lemma":"תְּרוּעָה","tr":"te·ru·ah","gloss":"shout","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":36},{"base":"H4550","lemma":"מַסַּע","tr":"mas·sa","gloss":"journey","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":12},{"base":"H4264","lemma":"מַחֲנֶה","tr":"ma·cha·neh","gloss":"camp","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":215},{"base":"H3259","lemma":"יָעַד","tr":"ya·ad","gloss":"to appoint","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":29},{"base":"H7321","lemma":"רוּעַ","tr":"ru·a","gloss":"to shout","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":44},{"base":"H2583","lemma":"חָנָה","tr":"cha·nah","gloss":"to camp","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":143},{"base":"H5265","lemma":"נָסַע","tr":"na·sa","gloss":"to set out","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":146},{"base":"H5712","lemma":"עֵדָה","tr":"e·dah","gloss":"congregation","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":149}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1SA","chapter":10,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"and said to the Israelites, “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘I brought Israel up out of Egypt, and I rescued you from the hands of the Egyptians and of all the kingdoms that oppressed you.’","from":9},{"book":"GEN","chapter":8,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"But God remembered Noah and all the animals and livestock that were with him in the ark. And God sent a wind over the earth, and the waters began to subside.","from":9},{"book":"JDG","chapter":2,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"Whenever the LORD raised up a judge for the Israelites, He was with that judge and saved them from the hands of their enemies while the judge was still alive; for the LORD was moved to pity by their groaning under those who oppressed them and afflicted them.","from":9},{"book":"PSA","chapter":106,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"Remember me, O LORD, in Your favor to Your people; visit me with Your salvation,","from":9},{"book":"PSA","chapter":106,"verse":42,"verseEnd":42,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"and subdued them under their hand.","from":9},{"book":"JER","chapter":4,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"Announce in Judah, proclaim in Jerusalem, and say: “Blow the ramʼs horn throughout the land. Cry aloud and say, ‘Assemble yourselves and let us flee to the fortified cities.’","from":3},{"book":"EXO","chapter":18,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Furthermore, select capable men from among the people—God-fearing, trustworthy men who are averse to dishonest gain. Appoint them over the people as leaders of thousands, of hundreds, of fifties, and of tens.","from":4},{"book":"NUM","chapter":7,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"And the leaders of Israel, the heads of their families, presented an offering. These men were the tribal leaders who had supervised the registration.","from":4}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":2}]},"11-28":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":2,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"amminadab-h5992g","name":"Amminadab","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Ram","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"nahshon-h5177","name":"Nah